From bba859dc44bdd12ff745fd116ca33daeceea3497 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:20:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Rating: add star rating component

New form component for setting and displaying a rating as stars
(5 by default, configurable via max).

- controlled (value + onChange) and uncontrolled (defaultValue) modes
- hover preview on devices with a mouse (hasMouse from adaptivity)
- keyboard: arrows change the rating by one star, Home/End set 1/max
- readOnly mode renders fractional values with a partially filled star
- disabled state, optional hidden input for forms (name)
- sizes s/m/l with platform-specific styles for ios/android/vkcom
- slider/img ARIA roles

Exported from the package root, styles added to styles.css,
docs registered in the Forms section of the styleguide.
